{
  "author": "veildawn",
  "description": {
    "en": "CommandCode multi-model API with Chat, Responses and Claude Messages, API-key account setup and model-specific routing.",
    "zh": "CommandCode 多模型 API，支持 Chat、Responses 与 Claude Messages，提供 API Key 账号配置与按模型协议路由。"
  },
  "docs": {
    "en": "Create a CommandCode API key in Studio (https://commandcode.ai/studio) and add an account. Use full model IDs, for example deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash. Claude models use Messages; other models use Chat and, where advertised by the official catalog, Responses. Models come from this account's own GET /models list; the manifest declares no static fallback, so a model the endpoint does not return is not offered. The account's 5-hour and weekly credit windows and remaining plan credits are polled from the billing credits endpoint. Provider API docs: https://commandcode.ai/docs/provider",
    "zh": "在 CommandCode Studio（https://commandcode.ai/studio）创建 API Key 后添加账号。使用完整模型 ID，例如 deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash。Claude 仅走 Messages；其他模型走 Chat，官方目录声明支持时可走 Responses。模型来自该账号自己的 GET /models 列表；清单不再声明静态目录，接口不返回的模型就不会出现在可选列表中。账号的 5 小时与每周额度窗口、剩余套餐额度通过账单接口轮询。接口文档：https://commandcode.ai/docs/provider"
  },
  "homepage": "https://commandcode.ai",
  "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
